add table ip ferm
delete table ip ferm
add table ip ferm
add set ip ferm recent_PROBE { type ipv4_addr; size 65535; flags dynamic,timeout; }
add chain ip ferm INPUT { type filter hook input priority 0; }
add rule ip ferm INPUT tcp dport 22 update @recent_PROBE { ip saddr timeout 1m limit rate over 6/minute burst 5 packets } drop
add rule ip ferm INPUT udp dport 22 update @recent_PROBE { ip saddr timeout 1m limit rate over 6/minute burst 5 packets } drop
